<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULT AT THE PILOT PEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULT AT THE PILOT PEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Connecticut 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result from the</p>
<p>$1.04 million Pilot Pen International Tennis Championships on</p>
<p>Sunday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat 8-Patrick Rafter</p>
<p>(Australia) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
</text>
